    "rich_text_x8fzqr": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_gNPc9K": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Beaded Bracelets from Shamballa Jewels<br/>Discover the enchanting world of beaded bracelets at Shamballa Jewels. Each bracelet is a tribute to elegance and individuality, handcrafted with precision in Copenhagen. Our beaded bracelets combine luxurious materials with exquisite design, making them the perfect accessory for any style-conscious individual.<br/><br/>Choice of Bead Sizes<br/>At Shamballa Jewels, we offer beaded bracelets in three different bead sizes: 10mm, 8mm, and 6mm. These round beads are available in a variety of materials, allowing you to find the perfect bracelet that suits your personal style. Whether you prefer the bold presence of 10mm beads or the subtle elegance of 6mm beads, we have something for everyone.<br/><br/>Exclusive Materials<br/>Our beaded bracelets are made from the finest materials, including 18-karat gold, rose gold, white gold, and black rhodinated gold. Each material adds its own unique charm and style to the bracelets. The warm glow of rose gold, the classic elegance of white gold, the sophisticated darkness of black rhodinated gold, or the timeless luxury of 18-karat gold – the choice is yours.<br/><br/>Diamonds and Precious Stones<br/>All our beaded bracelets are adorned with white or black diamonds, as well as other gemstones, adding an extra dimension of luxury and beauty. The white diamonds shine with their exceptional clarity, while the black diamonds exude mystery and elegance. Combined with other carefully selected gemstones, each bracelet becomes a unique piece of art.<br/><br/>Customization: Your Personal Touch<br/>We also offer the opportunity to customize your beaded bracelets to reflect your individual style. Choose from various materials, bead sizes, and gemstones to create a bracelet that is as unique as you are. Our skilled artisans will work with you to ensure that your bracelet is exactly as you desire.<br/><br/>Perfect for Women and Men<br/>Our beaded bracelets are designed for both women and men who appreciate exclusive jewelry. With a wide range of styles and materials, you can find the perfect bracelet that matches your personal taste and lifestyle. Shamballa Jewels' beaded bracelets are more than just jewelry; they are an extension of your personal style.<br/><br/>Discover Shamballa Jewels<br/>We invite you to explore our collection of beaded bracelets at our store in Copenhagen or online. Whether you are looking for the perfect bracelet for yourself or a special gift, our team is ready to help you find or design the ideal piece. Discover the unique world of Shamballa Jewels and add a touch of luxury to your jewelry collection with our beaded bracelets.<br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
